                            <h2>Improved Online Learning: Helping a University Increase Student Retention</h2>
<p><span data-sheets-value="{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;As part of an institution-wide effort to increase student retention, Strayer University was looking to reinvent\u2028online courses.. \n\nArmed with rich multimedia and educational expertise, we defined a whole new pedagogical approach to online learning. Our inspiring online course combined storytelling, animation, design, instructional content development, and real-life learning opportunities. It also doubled course success rates and lead to a 130% increase in engagement.&quot;}" data-sheets-userformat="{&quot;2&quot;:897,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}">As part of an institution-wide effort to increase student retention, Strayer University was looking to reinvent its approach to online courses.</span></p>
<p>Armed with rich multimedia and educational expertise, we defined a whole new pedagogical approach to online learning. Our inspiring online course combined storytelling, animation, design, instructional content development, and real-life learning opportunities. The new method doubled course success rates, and lead to a 130% increase in engagement.</p>
                        
                        

                        


                        


                        


                        

                        
                        
